<title>SWEDEN: Atlas Copco repeats forecast of higher '97 profit.</title>
<headline>Atlas Copco repeats forecast of higher '97 profit.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1997-04-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swedish engineer Atlas Copco on Monday repeated its forecast for a somewhat higher profit in 1997 compared to 1996 and said demand in 1997 is expected to remain largely unchanged.</p>
</text>
